graph TD
    A([🏛️ Start: Receive Escalated
Petition Notification]) --> B[(ERP DB: Fetch Full Petition
Audit Trail & All Prior Decisions)]
    B --> C[Review Complete History:
Student Record, Instructor Decision,
Advisor Recommendation]
    C --> D{Sufficient Context
to Decide?}
    D -- No --> E[Request Supplementary Info
from Relevant Party]
    E --> F[(ERP DB: Log Info Request
& Notify Instructor or Advisor)]
    F --> G[Await Response
& Re-review Submission]
    G --> C
    D -- Yes --> H[Conduct Executive Review
of Academic & Policy Merits]
    H --> I{Department Chair
Decision}
    I -- Override: Approve --> J[Document Override Rationale
with Chair Signature]
    J --> K[(ERP DB: Record Override Approval
& Update Petition Status)]
    K --> L[Notify Student, Instructor
& Advisor: Petition Approved]
    L --> M[(ERP DB: Trigger Registration
System to Enact Approval)]
    I -- Uphold Rejection --> N[Document Final Rejection
with Chair Authority Note]
    N --> O[(ERP DB: Record Final Rejection
& Close Petition)]
    O --> P[Notify Student:
Final Decision — No Further Appeal]
    I -- Conditional Approval --> Q[Set Conditions
e.g. Grade Minimums, Restrictions]
    Q --> R[(ERP DB: Save Conditional
Approval Terms)]
    R --> S[Notify Student:
Conditional Approval & Terms]
    M --> T([✅ End: Petition Fully Resolved])
    P --> T
    S --> T